      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of being a shadow is a heavy thing to carry, but you are so focused on protecting their feelings that you're erasing your own right to exist. They wouldn't want you to suffer in silence just to preserve a perfect memory of you. Instead of trying to maintain a flawless image for them, maybe you could find a way to just *be* for yourself, even if that means letting go of the expectation of perfection. It's a quiet, messy thing, but it's real.",
